From: RailgunHamster <railgunhamster@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 09:33:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: delayed hook injection for ACE-protected D3D12
 games

- Add RENDERDOC_DELAY_HOOKS/NO_INIT env vars to skip hook registration in rhdoc DllMain
- Export RHDOC_WrapD3D12Device, RHDOC_InstallDelayedHooks from rhdoc for post-creation device wrapping
- Rewrite d3d12 proxy: call real D3D12CreateDevice first, then load rhdoc and wrap device
- Fast-fail ForAllModules on ERROR_PARTIAL_COPY to avoid loader lock deadlock
- Key finding: PEB unlinking triggers ACE anti-cheat; without it ACE detects rhdoc ~45s after load
